WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.380
Hey guys!

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:01.800
I just got back from vacation,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.060
and contrary to popular belief,

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.500
I'm actually NOT DEAD.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.297
I just decided to take a little bit of break

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.007
after all my friends came into town,

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.902
and we were working like 18-hour days

00:00:09.902 --> 00:00:11.312
for 7 days straight.

00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:13.047
I needed to just clear my head a little bit.

00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:14.907
But while I was away I found that

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:17.757
I really wanted to be back and making videos again.

00:00:17.757 --> 00:00:19.327
And I'm sorry for the lack of videos.

00:00:19.327 --> 00:00:21.037
I actually didn't have time to prepare

00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:22.667
as much as I would have liked,

00:00:22.672 --> 00:00:24.442
because this vacation was planned a while ahead

00:00:24.442 --> 00:00:25.262
and blah blah blah.

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:26.282
I didn't tell you guys.

00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:27.982
I said on Facebook and Twitter, "I'm sorry

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:30.382
for the lack of videos over the past five days,"

00:00:30.382 --> 00:00:32.232
but now I'm more ready than ever

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:33.458
and I have got so many things

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:34.644
that I need to tell you about.

00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:37.930
First off: Bob started his own YouTube channel.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.080
He finally did it!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.780
We've been telling him to do it for years now,

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:43.760
and he finally is going to be making gameplay content

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.920
and other amazing stuff for you guys.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.663
As of right now I think he has a vlog up

00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:50.583
announcing what's going to be on the channel,

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.773
and his first gameplay video, so check him out

00:00:52.773 --> 00:00:54.173
in the link in the description below.

00:00:54.173 --> 00:00:56.663
And one of the really cool things that he talks about

00:00:56.663 --> 00:00:59.113
in his vlog is that he only really wants to

00:00:59.113 --> 00:01:01.663
make a channel to build up a community

00:01:01.663 --> 00:01:04.463
with which he can point in the right direction

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:05.023
and get to do

00:01:05.373 --> 00:01:07.313
get them to do great things.

00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:09.753
Which is all I've ever wanted about our community.

00:01:10.143 --> 00:01:11.433
And the great thing is that

00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:13.293
the bigger our community gets

00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:14.663
the more good we can do.

00:01:14.663 --> 00:01:16.073
Obviously, that's, you know,

00:01:16.073 --> 00:01:17.553
not really in question,

00:01:17.553 --> 00:01:19.223
but the problem is

00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:20.583
that there are so many people,

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:22.923
it's hard to point you guys in the right direction.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.800
And...I...I've kinda let that slip through the cracks,

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.560
because I've had plans
to make this happen for a while.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.510
I've just haven't done anything about it.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.030
But now that I'm back,

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.030
and now that I know that this is all happening,

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.960
now I want to dedicate myself more

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.980
to making sure that you guys

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:41.080
have a method by which to interact with one another

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.350
and organize for these bigger events.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.010
So, I'm going to be making a website.

00:01:46.304 --> 00:01:49.594
One with a simple forum system, polling and blogging,

00:01:49.594 --> 00:01:51.814
um, and other features that you guys can

00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:52.874
suggest in the comments below.

00:01:52.874 --> 00:01:55.534
I want you guys to tell me what you want on the website.

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:58.494
But...I've had Markiplier.com reserved

00:01:58.494 --> 00:01:59.784
for a long time now.

00:01:59.784 --> 00:02:01.184
I just didn't know what to do with it,

00:02:01.184 --> 00:02:03.174
and there were other things that we're planning for,

00:02:03.174 --> 00:02:06.244
and, uh, I-I've just decided to forget all of that,

00:02:06.244 --> 00:02:08.474
and just get this place,

00:02:08.474 --> 00:02:09.562
Markiplier.com,

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.672
as a portal for you guys

00:02:11.672 --> 00:02:13.682
all to rally the community together.

00:02:13.682 --> 00:02:15.532
And I want you guys to have a place

00:02:15.532 --> 00:02:18.462
where we can all share our ideas,

00:02:18.462 --> 00:02:21.242
you know, we can all promote, uh,
each other's, you know,

00:02:21.242 --> 00:02:22.552
big events that we wanna do.

00:02:22.552 --> 00:02:23.762
We can organize charity things,

00:02:23.762 --> 00:02:25.602
we can organize, uh, different fun times,

00:02:25.602 --> 00:02:27.602
playing games with me, uh,

00:02:27.602 --> 00:02:29.452
playing games with each other, you know.

00:02:29.452 --> 00:02:30.972
Making things bigger and better

00:02:30.972 --> 00:02:32.602
for our community as a whole,

00:02:32.602 --> 00:02:33.542
which is just

00:02:33.542 --> 00:02:35.632
one of the best communities on YouTube, by far.

00:02:35.632 --> 00:02:37.842
And I'm not even saying that just to stroke your egos.

00:02:37.851 --> 00:02:41.551
Like, you ask around, and, like, uuuh...

00:02:41.551 --> 00:02:43.161
just checking the comments on some people's

00:02:43.161 --> 00:02:44.841
YouTube channels and it's just...

00:02:44.841 --> 00:02:47.461
it's animalistic, it's brutal—not all! But I mean

00:02:47.461 --> 00:02:48.591
some of 'em are just like

00:02:48.591 --> 00:02:49.831
they're constantly fighting

00:02:49.831 --> 00:02:51.721
and they're constantly bickering with one another,

00:02:51.721 --> 00:02:53.841
and I've never seen that with ours.

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.901
And I read a lot of the comments

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.421
I get posted on my videos.

00:02:57.421 --> 00:02:59.132
And so, I know what you guys are saying,

00:02:59.132 --> 00:03:01.192
and it really does warm my heart

00:03:01.192 --> 00:03:03.562
that you guys have been non-stop supportive.

00:03:03.744 --> 00:03:04.934
So I wanna make a place

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:07.214
where we can all channel that effort.

00:03:07.214 --> 00:03:08.318
So thank you guys.

00:03:08.318 --> 00:03:10.668
And that'll be up, very soon.

00:03:10.737 --> 00:03:12.687
The other thing that I let fall through the cracks

00:03:12.687 --> 00:03:14.077
while I was on vacation was that

00:03:14.077 --> 00:03:16.517
I was part of another Guns of Icarus tournament.

00:03:16.517 --> 00:03:17.657
I know you guys loved the last one,

00:03:17.657 --> 00:03:20.797
because it was me, JesseCox, Cryaotic and Dodger,

00:03:20.797 --> 00:03:22.217
all together on a ship against

00:03:22.217 --> 00:03:24.657
TB and his gnarly crew of pirates.

00:03:24.663 --> 00:03:26.463
Well, we're pirates too. But they're also—

00:03:26.463 --> 00:03:27.233
They're bad pirates.

00:03:27.233 --> 00:03:27.883
We're good p—

00:03:27.883 --> 00:03:30.673
We're not good pirates, but we're pirates nonetheless.

00:03:30.673 --> 00:03:32.013
STOP [Markiplier.exe encountered an error]

00:03:32.013 --> 00:03:32.563
Either way,

00:03:32.563 --> 00:03:34.113
there were supposed to be videos on my channel

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.153
announcing it, but I uploaded it before—

00:03:36.153 --> 00:03:37.883
right before I went to vacation,

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:38.843
and they didn't upload.

00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:41.283
So either way, here is some of 'em:

00:03:41.459 --> 00:03:43.109
What is...?
[laughing]

00:03:43.109 --> 00:03:43.499
Huh?

00:03:43.499 --> 00:03:43.969
[Dodger noises]

00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:46.154
Cry: Shit, I don't get it either.

00:03:46.154 --> 00:03:47.943
Cry: I used to be pretty good at getting things...
Jesse: MarkApply!

00:03:47.943 --> 00:03:49.242
Jesse: Mark - did he - apply it?

00:03:49.242 --> 00:03:54.565
[everyone suddenly understands everything]

00:03:54.565 --> 00:03:55.318
Jesse: That was a cl--

00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:58.003
Jesse: That was a clever, clever thing I did.

00:03:58.399 --> 00:04:01.209
Oh, oh yeah, that was hhhhorribly funny.

00:04:01.209 --> 00:04:02.639
Terribly funny. Incredible.
Cry: That was great.

00:04:02.639 --> 00:04:04.379
[laughing]

00:04:04.379 --> 00:04:07.319
Here's uss, chustomishing!
Jesse: Ummm...

00:04:07.529 --> 00:04:08.711
Dodger: Yes, that.
Jesse: You could be like: ...

00:04:08.711 --> 00:04:11.305
Look at all the colors that we can do!
Jesse: ..."Hello everybody!"

00:04:12.056 --> 00:04:12.936
Jesse: "Welcome back toooo...

00:04:12.936 --> 00:04:14.596
Cry: All the colors of the wind?
Jesse: ...Guns of Icarus Online.

00:04:14.596 --> 00:04:16.776
Jesse: It's a rematch against TotalBiscuit...

00:04:16.776 --> 00:04:18.916
Jesse: ...and we're gonna battle them again.

00:04:18.916 --> 00:04:23.286
Jesse: But first! We're gonna do some customization
of our characters and ship to make it...

00:04:23.286 --> 00:04:26.246
Jesse ...the way we want. So this time we win."
Something like that?

00:04:26.648 --> 00:04:28.218
That's good. We'll go with that one.

00:04:28.218 --> 00:04:29.348
Y--that was perfect.
Dodger: We'll just use that.

00:04:29.348 --> 00:04:30.008
Dodger: Yeah.

00:04:30.008 --> 00:04:31.238
[everyone agrees]

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:33.334
I liked the whole questioning tone throughout...

00:04:33.334 --> 00:04:34.604
...the entire story.
Dodger: Yeah, but...

00:04:34.604 --> 00:04:37.144
Dodger: ...but I'm not quite convinced of this myself.

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:38.914
Dodger: But when you say it later...
Mark: We're gonna customiiiiize?

00:04:38.914 --> 00:04:40.624
Dodger: ...you should sound convinced.

00:04:40.624 --> 00:04:42.474
And beat 'em? I dunno.

00:04:42.744 --> 00:04:44.094
[Trailer-guy voice] IN A WORLD...

00:04:44.094 --> 00:04:47.804
...WHERE 4 PEOPLE GET ON
THE STEEL BUTTERFLY...

00:04:47.974 --> 00:04:49.874
...THEY MUST FIRST FIGURE OUT...

00:04:49.874 --> 00:04:51.584
...WHAT COLORS THEY WANT...

00:04:51.584 --> 00:04:54.424
...FOR THEIR CHARACTEEEEERH.

00:04:54.654 --> 00:04:55.184
That good?

00:04:56.599 --> 00:04:56.879
Dodger: Hmmm....

00:04:56.879 --> 00:04:58.169
Jesse: Yeah, that's great!
But we're gonna do the ship...

00:04:58.169 --> 00:04:59.219
Jesse: ...cause our characters are already done.

00:04:59.219 --> 00:04:59.989
Jesse: But good effort.

00:04:59.989 --> 00:05:00.562
Jesse: Good effort.
Mark: FUCK!

00:05:00.562 --> 00:05:01.365
GODDAMMIT!

00:05:01.365 --> 00:05:02.409
[laughing]

00:05:02.409 --> 00:05:04.149
I thought you're still on the character bit.

00:05:05.027 --> 00:05:05.857
Dodger: Good job everybody!

00:05:05.857 --> 00:05:06.377
Jesse: All right, that's it!

00:05:06.377 --> 00:05:07.707
Jesse: We're done! We did it! YAAAAAY!

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:08.587
Jesse: Ok, now what?

00:05:09.098 --> 00:05:09.668
So anyway...

00:05:09.668 --> 00:05:11.728
...that's all the cool stuff that's coming in the future.

00:05:11.728 --> 00:05:14.098
I'm sorry for dropping the ball on a number of videos...

00:05:14.098 --> 00:05:16.278
...over the past week, but I promise...

00:05:16.278 --> 00:05:18.948
...that I will get more engaged in it in the future.

00:05:18.948 --> 00:05:21.068
Because I am more dedicated than ever.

00:05:21.068 --> 00:05:22.818
Whenever I take a break or a vacation...

00:05:22.818 --> 00:05:25.018
...I'm always sitting where I'm supposed to be...

00:05:25.018 --> 00:05:25.998
...having fun, going:

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.250
"Well, this is kinda fun, but I could be home...

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:33.250
...making videos right now. FOR MY FANS!"

00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:35.456
But then I decide that I'll go...

00:05:35.586 --> 00:05:36.676
...ride a rollercoaster, of something...

00:05:36.676 --> 00:05:37.626
...and it'll be more fun.

00:05:37.626 --> 00:05:39.726
So, either way, thanks you guys so much.

00:05:39.726 --> 00:05:42.126
I will hopefully get the website up...

00:05:42.316 --> 00:05:44.226
...in about 2 or 3 weeks here.

00:05:44.226 --> 00:05:46.476
I'm gonna really, really plow at it...

00:05:46.576 --> 00:05:48.446
...and get it all out of the way and done...

00:05:48.446 --> 00:05:51.596
...and ready for you guys to use as soon as possible.

00:05:51.596 --> 00:05:53.616
Thank you guys so much for believing in me...

00:05:53.616 --> 00:05:55.956
...and helping me with what I do.

00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:59.466
So, sincerely, thank you all so much for watching...

00:05:59.664 --> 00:06:00.614
...and as always...

00:06:00.856 --> 00:06:01.946
...I will see YOU...

00:06:02.506 --> 00:06:03.650
...in the next video.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.550
Buh-bye!

